# Deliberate delta vs the verbatim pmOS config: G_SERIAL as a module so it
# does NOT auto-own the single UDC at boot (only this symbol differs).
# davinci-net-gadget (initramfs hook + real-root service) then binds a
# configfs ACM+ECM composite: serial console/logs + USB networking for SSH.
# NOTE (verified against drivers/usb/gadget/Kconfig): demoting G_SERIAL
# also demotes LIBCOMPOSITE/F_ACM/F_SERIAL/F_OBEX/U_SERIAL/U_ETHER/F_ECM
# to =m (their only =y selector is gone; bool CONFIGFS_* selects cap at
# m). Those live in the initramfs MODULES and are modprobed by the gadget
# setup; U_SERIAL_CONSOLE stays builtin (bool deps accept =m).
CONFIG_USB_G_SERIAL=m
